{"sha": "8154a0236634cf54316ce1ee01efdf02d49e2de1a5d8acf546ebd325d72febe4", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:special-relativity} 章 --- 狭义相对论：时间延缓}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:1}", "$\\gamma = 1/\\sqrt{1 - (v/c)^2}$：$1.01$（$0.1c$）；$1.25$（$0.6c$）；", "$1.67$（$0.8c$）；$10.0$（$0.995c$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:2}", "$\\gamma = 1.25$，故地面测得 $1.25 \\times 10.0 =", "\\qty{12.5}{s}$。飞船上的 \\qty{10.0}{s} 是固有时：", "节拍器（同一只钟）在两次拍击时都在场。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:3}", "$v = c\\sqrt{1 - 1/\\gamma^2}$：$\\gamma = 2$ 时 $v = 0.866c$；", "$\\gamma = 10$ 时 $v = 0.995c$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:4}", "$v = \\qty{36.1}{m/s}$，$v/c = \\num{1.2e-7}$；", "$\\gamma - 1 \\approx (\\num{1.2e-7})^2/2 \\approx \\num{7.2e-15}$。损失一秒需要", "$1/\\num{7.2e-15} \\approx \\qty{1.4e14}{s}$ ——约", "四百万年的驾驶时间。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:5}", "乘客迎着前端闪光运动，因此闪光先到达他处；", "由第二假设，两道闪光以相同的 $c$ 传播，经过", "在\\emph{他的参考系中}相等的半车厢距离，因此", "先到达即先发生。同时性与参考系有关：每个", "结论在其各自的参考系中都是正确的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:6}", "$\\gamma = 1/\\sqrt{1 - 0.99^2} = 7.09$；实验室中的寿命为", "$7.09 \\times \\num{2.6e-8} = \\qty{1.8e-7}{s}$。经典射程", "$0.99 \\times \\num{3.00e8} \\times \\num{2.6e-8} \\approx \\qty{7.7}{m}$；", "实际射程 $7.09 \\times 7.7 \\approx \\qty{55}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:7}", "当 $\\gamma = 1.5$ 时 $v = c\\sqrt{1 - 1/2.25} \\approx 0.75c$；", "$\\gamma = 3$ 时 $\\approx 0.94c$。渐近情形：$\\gamma$（以及", "继续加速所需的能量代价）随 $v \\to c$ 趋于无穷——", "无论付出多大努力，都无法使有质量的物体达到光速。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:8}", "$\\Delta t_0 = 2L/c = 3.0/\\num{3.00e8} = \\qty{1.0e-8}{s}$；在 $0.8c$ 时，", "$\\gamma = 5/3$，故 $\\Delta t = \\qty{1.7e-8}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:9}", "固有时属于在两个事件处都在场的钟：(a) 佩戴者；", "(b) μ 子；(c) 飞行员——只有飞船同时在", "出发与到达两个事件处都在场。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:10}", "$\\gamma - 1 \\approx 7700^2/(2 \\times \\num{9.0e16}) \\approx", "\\num{3.3e-10}$；经过 \\qty{1.58e7}{s} 后，宇航员落后", "$\\num{3.3e-10} \\times \\num{1.58e7} \\approx \\qty{5.2e-3}{s}$ ——约", "年轻五毫秒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:11}", "$E = \\num{1.0e-3} \\times (\\num{3.00e8})^2 = \\qty{9.0e13}{J}$。", "一座 \\qty{1.0}{GW} 的电站每天输出 $\\num{1.0e9} \\times 86400 \\approx", "\\qty{8.6e13}{J}$ ——一克物质相当于该电站一天的输出，而", "$\\num{9.0e13}/\\num{8.5e5} \\approx \\num{e8}$：相当于一亿辆", "飞驰的汽车。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:12}", "两边平方并取倒数：$\\gamma^2(1 - v^2/c^2) = 1$，故", "$v^2/c^2 = 1 - 1/\\gamma^2$，因此 $v = c\\sqrt{1 - 1/\\gamma^2}$。", "当 $\\gamma = 30$ 时，$v = c\\sqrt{1 - 1/900} = 0.99944c$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:13}", "收缩后的厚度 $L = \\qty{15}{km}/30 = \\qty{500}{m}$；穿越时间", "$500/(0.99944 \\times \\num{3.00e8}) \\approx \\qty{1.7e-6}{s} <", "\\qty{2.2}{\\micro s}$。两个参考系都同意 μ 子能到达地面——", "一方归因于寿命被拉长，另一方归因于大气层被压缩。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:14}", "实验室中：$3200/\\num{3.00e8} \\approx \\qty{1.1e-5}{s}$（速率", "$\\approx c$）。电子参考系中：管长收缩为", "$3200/\\num{1.0e5} = \\qty{3.2}{cm}$，穿越时间为", "$\\num{1.1e-5}/\\num{1.0e5} \\approx \\qty{1.1e-10}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:special-relativity:15}", "地球上：$4.2/0.9 \\approx \\qty{4.7}{years}$。由于", "$\\gamma = 1/\\sqrt{1 - 0.81} = 2.29$，探测器的钟记录", "$4.7/2.29 \\approx \\qty{2.0}{years}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:special-relativity:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $c\\,\\Delta t_0 = \\num{3.00e8} \\times \\num{2.2e-6} \\approx", "\\qty{660}{m}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\num{15000}/660 \\approx 23$ 个寿命。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\mathrm{e}^{-23} \\approx \\num{e-10}$：每一百亿个 μ 子中", "应只有不到一个到达，然而通量是每 \\unit{cm^2} 每", "分钟一个——经典物理被天空彻底否定了。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 地面寿命 $30 \\times \\qty{2.2}{\\micro s} =", "\\qty{66}{\\micro s}$；射程 $\\approx \\num{3.00e8} \\times \\num{6.6e-5}", "\\approx \\qty{20}{km} > \\qty{15}{km}$：到达现象得到了解释。", ""]}